Package: indi-bin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libindi-data (= ${source:Version}), libindi-plugins (= ${binary:Version})
Description: INDI server, core drivers and command line tools
 Control astronomical equipment using the INDI protocol.
 Includes simulated devices for testing without attached hardware.

Package: libindi-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: shared data for INDI
 Device definitions for the INDI core drivers.

Package: libindiclient2
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: INDI client library
 Shared library for clients of INDI astronomical devices.

